# ISOs never enter git (2.4+ GiB each). COBRA OS ships NO prebuilt ISO —
# users build their own with build-iso.sh (see website/README.md). This dir
# carries only the reference .sha256 sidecars so operators can hash-compare
# their own builds against ours. Never on Cloudflare Pages (25 MiB cap),
# never in a clearnet object store.
*.iso

# Ignore everything except this .gitignore and the .sha256 sidecars.
*
!.gitignore
!*.sha256
